Description: Add BGRX to x11 bindings for native pixmap
 Make x11 native pixmap binding accept BGRX as well as BGRA.
 The reason for wanting this is that the Raspberry H.264 V4L2 decoder
 ends up selecting RGBX as its output format when decoding video and
 without this patch the video is just black. The Raspberry Pi4 stateful
 video decode has a non-optional h/w convert stage after the decode so
 chromium finds BGRX as the best match for output under X11 - it won't
 convert to BGRA.
 .
 To test this BGRX has been added to ozone_gl_unittests
 ozone_gl_unittests was previously broken so it always skipped its tests,
 this has been fixed. Texture type of the test changed to GL_TEXTURE_2D
 as X11 doesn't support GL_TEXTURE_EXTERNAL_OES and so would fail.
 .
